GR.SEQ.P:
When collecting, carrying, storing and delivering air cargo/mail to which security controls have been applied [on behalf of 
name of regulated agent/air carrier applying security controls for cargo or mail/known consignor/account consignor
], I confirm that the following security procedures will be adhered to:

Any entity (

the supplier

) that ensures the security controls as referred to in point 8.1.5 and delivers in-flight supplies, but not directly to aircraft, shall be designated as a known supplier by the operator or the entity to whom it delivers (

the designating entity

). This shall not apply to a regulated supplier.

Any entity (

the supplier

) that ensures the security controls as referred to in point 9.1.4 and delivers airport supplies shall be designated as a known supplier by the airport operator.

TXT.HT:
EU aviation security validation report (
the validation report
)
